OL,3,ABurnham planning to visit US in
OL,4,ASeptember to lobby Trump on Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Prime Minister Andy Burnham says he
OL,7,Fplans to travel to the US next month
OL,8,Fwith European leaders to lobby US
OL,9,FPresident Trump on Ukraine's defence
OL,10,Fneeds.
OL,12,FIn an interview with Bloomberg, Burnham
OL,13,Fsaid, "I'm looking forward to going to
OL,14,FNew York in September," when the UN
OL,15,FGeneral Assembly will meet.
OL,17,FHe said that while the details were not
OL,18,F"fully confirmed", it is "likely" he
OL,19,Fwill go. The trip would be his first to
OL,20,Fthe US since becoming prime minister in
OL,21,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
