OL,3,ABurnham planning to visit US in
OL,4,ASeptember to lobby Trump on Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Leaving today, I'm quite clear what I
OL,7,Fneed to do in the next few weeks," he
OL,8,Fsaid following his official visit to
OL,9,FUkraine on Monday, during which he
OL,10,Fpromised to continue pressuring Russia.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
